LODESTONE — third-party assets used in this film

Fonts
Alfa Slab One, Bagel Fat One, JetBrains Mono, Archivo — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (via Fontsource / github.com/google/fonts)
Chewy — Apache License 2.0 (via Fontsource)

Voice
Kokoro-82M text-to-speech (Apache 2.0), voice bm_george, via kokoro-onnx

Music and sound
Fully synthesized in audio/mix.py (no samples), instruments adapted from the Halftone Dossier demo score

Engine and tools
Lemo-Opuscar library (MIT) by Lemomo — Halftone Dossier style (engine adapted to 1080×1920 with English captions as
studio/kits/halftone-dossier/dossier.js) and core render tools

No photographs, logos, stock footage or AI-generated video are used: everything is drawn in code.
